问题找到了，在生成的配置文件里有错误的DNS配置。
把detour中的"direct"改成"proxy"就解决了。
```
      {
        "tag": "local",
        "address": "223.5.5.5",
        "strategy": "ipv4_only",
        "detour": "direct"
      },
      {
        "tag": "block",
        "address": "rcode://success"
      },
      {
        "tag": "local_local",
        "address": "223.5.5.5",
        "detour": "direct"
      }
```

