据我测试，不能访问 ipv6 网站的原因在于 v2rayN的默认DNS配置里面，`server` 限定了 `"strategy": "ipv4_only"` ；并且，目前的UI中，好像没办法通过设置来变更这个信息。

如果希望访问 ipv6 ，把其中的 `ipv4_only` 改为 `prefer_ipv4` 即可，也就是把下面的配置内容作为自定义的 DNS 内容：

```
{
    "servers": [
        {
            "tag": "remote",
            "address": "8.8.8.8",
            "strategy": "prefer_ipv4",
            "detour": "proxy"
        },
        {
            "tag": "local",
            "address": "223.5.5.5",
            "strategy": "prefer_ipv4",
            "detour": "direct"
        },
        {
            "tag": "block",
            "address": "rcode://success"
        }
    ],
    "rules": [
        {
            "server": "local_local",
            "domain": [
                "xxx"
            ]
        },
        {
            "server": "remote",
            "clash_mode": "Global"
        },
        {
            "server": "local_local",
            "clash_mode": "Direct"
        },
        {
            "server": "local",
            "rule_set": [
                "geosite-cn",
                "geosite-geolocation-cn"
            ]
        },
        {
            "server": "block",
            "rule_set": [
                "geosite-category-ads-all"
            ]
        }
    ],
    "final": "remote"
}
```

