**Key points:**
- Custom DNS is **enabled** (`Enable Custom DNS` toggle is ON)
- DNS `final` is set to `quad9-https` (DoH via proxy) — this should be the default resolver
- `default_domain_resolver` is `bootstrap-udp` (UDP to 9.9.9.9 via direct)
- But the generated `configPre.json` contains **none of these servers** — only `dhcp://auto` tagged as `local_local`
- "Outbound DNS address" dropdown at the bottom of DNS Settings is set to `dhcp://auto`

